      "abstract": "Note that OSF has a 50 GB storage limit, which prevented us from including all participant data. As a result, we deposited the dataset on OpenNeuro: https://openneuro.org/datasets/ds007629. OpenNeuro requires the dataset to follow the BIDS format standard. For researchers looking for the preprocessed and synchronized EEG + eye-tracking data with labels (Pickle format), these files are available under: derivatives/synced/ Thank you for your understanding, and please feel free to reach out if you have any questions.",
